[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3123445362","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109007#issuecomment-3123445362","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109007","id":3123445362,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66K_5y","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-26T22:15:02Z","updated_at":"2025-07-26T22:15:02Z","body":"> pressing command q or command w when Godot editor settings doesn't work nothing happens\n\nNeither you can close it with window title \"x\" button while exclusive child dialog like “editor settings” is open. This feels like is expected behavior, why would “close file”  shortcut do anything in editor settings.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3123445362/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124284032","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109007#issuecomment-3124284032","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109007","id":3124284032,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66OMqA","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-27T10:13:24Z","updated_at":"2025-07-27T10:18:24Z","body":"> > pressing command q or command w when Godot editor settings doesn't work nothing happens\n> \n> Neither you can close it with window title \"x\" button while exclusive child dialog like “editor settings” is open. This feels like is expected behavior, why would “close file” shortcut do anything in editor settings.\n\nIt's expected behavior on macOS. `cmd + w` should close the current window, even if it is not a file window. Doing so in the Safari preferences, for example, closes the preferences window. The only exception is modals, which are closed with `escape`. `cmd + q` is expected to work no matter what the current focus is (except if there's a modal open).\n\nEdit: I can confirm that `cmd + w` and `cmd + q` do nothing in the preferences still on 4.5 beta, I agree this should be addressed.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124284032/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124380218","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109007#issuecomment-3124380218","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109007","id":3124380218,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66OkI6","user":{"login":"DannyDevSe","id":102230735,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhfqzw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102230735?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe","html_url":"https://github.com/DannyDevSe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-27T12:31:40Z","updated_at":"2025-07-27T12:31:40Z","body":"Im new to macOS so im only comparing to how it works on safari in the command , window there it closes the settings window with cmd w and the full program with cmd q ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124380218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124457208","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109007#issuecomment-3124457208","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109007","id":3124457208,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66O274","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-27T14:33:44Z","updated_at":"2025-07-27T14:33:44Z","body":"CMD+W to close the current sub-window can be added without any issues.\n\nCMD+Q from on the other hand should be handled by each individual sub-window, since it's not always feasible to quit immediately and can easily break the editor.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124457208/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124476654","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109007#issuecomment-3124476654","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109007","id":3124476654,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66O7ru","user":{"login":"DannyDevSe","id":102230735,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhfqzw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102230735?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe","html_url":"https://github.com/DannyDevSe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DannyDevSe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-27T15:00:12Z","updated_at":"2025-07-27T15:00:12Z","body":"In that case, I think making both shortcuts close the sub-window is reasonable. Also, this issue affects all sub-windows.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124476654/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124497426","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109007#issuecomment-3124497426","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109007","id":3124497426,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66PAwS","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-27T15:36:35Z","updated_at":"2025-07-27T16:28:53Z","body":"> CMD+W to close the current sub-window can be added without any issues.\n\nGreat!\n\n> CMD+Q from on the other hand should be handled by each individual sub-window, since it's not always feasible to quit immediately and can easily break the editor.\n\nThe current behavior for `cmd + q` in the editor windows spawns a confirmation modal, which is good:\n\n<img width=\"471\" height=\"163\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/184dbfcb-276e-4716-8d7d-301b5955c217\" />\n\nI'd expect `cmd + q` to behave the same if pressed from any window (including settings). In macOS, I think it's usually implemented by going through all windows successively, asking them to close, which they may reject (or stall) if they have unsaved changes. If all close successfully, the app quits.\n\n> In that case, I think making both shortcuts close the sub-window is reasonable. Also, this issue affects all sub-windows.\n\nI don't think this is a sufficient solution, I expect `cmd + q` to quit the app, not to just close the window.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124497426/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124507224","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109007#issuecomment-3124507224","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109007","id":3124507224,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66PDJY","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-27T15:54:57Z","updated_at":"2025-07-27T15:54:57Z","body":"> If all close successfully, the app quits\n\nThere's no way to check if the window did close (or when it is closed and what casused it to close), right now it's only possible to force close child window, or send notification to close (equivalent of close button press). And I'm not sure if force closing all editor windows is safe.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124507224/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124508623","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109007#issuecomment-3124508623","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109007","id":3124508623,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66PDfP","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-27T15:57:47Z","updated_at":"2025-07-27T15:57:47Z","body":"Current state is:\n- CMD-W is local editor shortcut to close tabs/open scripts, not processed by anything else.\n- CMD-Q is handled globally and send `DisplayServer::WINDOW_EVENT_CLOSE_REQUEST` event to the main window, if there's exclusive child it is completely ignored, otherwise send `NOTIFICATION_WM_CLOSE_REQUEST` notification.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124508623/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5494536269","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109007#issuecomment-5494536269","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109007","id":5494536269,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABR3_4TQ","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-01T13:16:45Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T13:16:45Z","body":"Cmd+W was fixed in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107303","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5494536269/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]